1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,220
Every morning, she sat at the same café table.

2
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:05,135
Her sketchbook on the table.

3
00:00:05,135 --> 00:00:06,970
Her bag on the other chair.

4
00:00:06,970 --> 00:00:10,421
One day, a man asked, “Is this seat taken?”

5
00:00:10,421 --> 00:00:13,016
She hesitated... then moved her bag.

6
00:00:13,016 --> 00:00:16,222
They sat quietly, until he noticed her drawing.

7
00:00:16,222 --> 00:00:17,853
“You drew this place?”

8
00:00:17,853 --> 00:00:18,858
She nodded.

9
00:00:18,858 --> 00:00:20,298
And they started talking.

10
00:00:20,298 --> 00:00:23,125
The next morning, she left his chair empty.

11
00:00:23,125 --> 00:00:24,347
But he didn't come.

12
00:00:24,347 --> 00:00:26,793
For three days, she watched the door.

13
00:00:26,793 --> 00:00:29,293
On the fourth, she put her bag back.

14
00:00:29,293 --> 00:00:32,350
Then she heard, “I tried drawing our table.”

15
00:00:32,350 --> 00:00:34,021
He was holding a sketchbook.

16
00:00:34,021 --> 00:00:35,475
The table was crooked.

17
00:00:35,475 --> 00:00:37,350
The cups looked like potatoes.

18
00:00:37,350 --> 00:00:40,964
She laughed, moved her bag... and pulled out his chair.

